    {
      "subId": "7307020",
      "subQuestName": "Head to the designated location to look for clues about Ashvattha's Concourses",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730702001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730702001": {
            "id": "730702001",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "We now have the second Vasoma Fruit!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730702002"
            ]
          },
          "730702002": {
            "id": "730702002",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "#Impressive! Nara {NICKNAME} is not afraid of Marana and even drove all the monsters away. No wonder you could defeat Vanagni!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730702003"
            ]
          },
          "730702003": {
            "id": "730702003",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hehe, the many adventures we've been through aren't just for show, y'know?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730702004"
            ]
          },
          "730702004": {
            "id": "730702004",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "#That's great! Then Nara {NICKNAME} and Paimon must have many memories and stories, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730702007"
            ]
          },
          "730702007": {
            "id": "730702007",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "#I see. If you don't mind, we'd love to hear Nara {NICKNAME} and Paimon's stories sometime.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730702008"
            ]
          },
          "730702008": {
            "id": "730702008",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Sure! We've shared our stories with others before, though it feels like so long ago...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730702009"
            ]
          },
          "730702009": {
            "id": "730702009",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Speaking of which, Paimon saw a giant purple tree in the distance while we were in the Vasara Tree's dream. Paimon's pretty sure we saw it in Vanarana, too. What was that?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730702010"
            ]
          },
          "730702010": {
            "id": "730702010",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "That's the very first Ashvattha's Tree of Dreams. Hmm, how should I put this...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730702011"
            ]
          },
          "730702011": {
            "id": "730702011",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "Dreams are like leaves in a stream. They soon float away with the water. If you want to keep a dream in place, you have to let it grow roots. That way, the dream won't drift away.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730702012"
            ]
          },
          "730702012": {
            "id": "730702012",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "Hmm... it's so hard to explain..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7307004",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Arama",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730700401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730700401": {
            "id": "730700401",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Arama! Here we are again!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730700402"
            ]
          },
          "730700402": {
            "id": "730700402",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "#Yes! Nara {NICKNAME} and Paimon! Hello! This is Arasudraka.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730700403"
            ]
          },
          "730700403": {
            "id": "730700403",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arasudraka",
            "text": "#Ooh! Nara {NICKNAME} and Paimon! Nice to meet you! The Golden Nara is tall and strong, just like the song says!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730700404"
            ]
          },
          "730700404": {
            "id": "730700404",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon's really happy to meet you, too! Is Arasudraka a friend of yours, Arama?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730700405"
            ]
          },
          "730700405": {
            "id": "730700405",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "Yes! Arasudraka is a \"song gatherer\" and often goes to collect all sorts of songs.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730700406"
            ]
          },
          "730700406": {
            "id": "730700406",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "Before seeds became saplings, we hid in the leaves together and went to the Dendro Archon's big tree. We watched the Nara sing as they drank water that made them turn silly!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730700407"
            ]
          },
          "730700407": {
            "id": "730700407",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arasudraka",
            "text": "#Nara {NICKNAME} and Paimon, do you know any songs?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730700408"
            ]
          },
          "730700408": {
            "id": "730700408",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Songs... If it were that green fellow, he should know plenty of them!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730700409"
            ]
          },
          "730700409": {
            "id": "730700409",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arasudraka",
            "text": "The green fellow? What's that? A Dusk Bird? A Shroomboar?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730700410"
            ]
          },
          "730700410": {
            "id": "730700410",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "No, no! He is the Anemo Archon of Mondstadt, and also a bard.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730700411"
            ]
          },
          "730700411": {
            "id": "730700411",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arasudraka",
            "text": "Wow! Then he must know a lot of songs!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730700412"
            ]
          },
          "730700412": {
            "id": "730700412",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "Amazing! The Anemo Archon must be able to blow the songs to faraway places with the wind!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730700413"
            ]
          },
          "730700413": {
            "id": "730700413",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yep! Speaking of which, is this one of Ashvattha's Concourses?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730700414"
            ]
          },
          "730700414": {
            "id": "730700414",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "No, it is not. But it is a great discovery nonetheless. Here lies a song that we Aranara have been unable to find for many, many years.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730700415"
            ]
          },
          "730700415": {
            "id": "730700415",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "Aranara song gatherers always pursue the beauty of songs. At the end of time, they will leave behind a song that belongs only to themselves.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730700417",
              "730700419"
            ]
          },
          "730700417": {
            "id": "730700417",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arasudraka",
            "text": "Seems like here is a song left by Aramaha. If it's true, there should be a Vasara Tree nearby!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730700420"
            ]
          },
          "730700420": {
            "id": "730700420",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon remembers Araja saying something about the Vasara Trees... Let Paimon check the Aranyaka real quick...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730700421"
            ]
          },
          "730700421": {
            "id": "730700421",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Vasara Trees bear Vasoma Fruits! We should help them, {NICKNAME}!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730700422"
            ]
          },
          "730700422": {
            "id": "730700422",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "Yay! I get to study songs of the past with Nara!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730700423"
            ]
          },
          "730700423": {
            "id": "730700423",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arasudraka",
            "text": "Aramaha loves this type of rose, but it was Arayama who discovered the way to hide songs in roses! Arayama was proud, so Arayama's roses are proud, too.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730700424"
            ]
          },
          "730700424": {
            "id": "730700424",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arasudraka",
            "text": "So the roses won't tell us. Only a smart Aranara, or maybe a smart Nara, can find the hidden song. But Arasudraka is not smart enough...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730700425"
            ]
          },
          "730700425": {
            "id": "730700425",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Don't worry! Hehe, {NICKNAME} is very smart!"
          },
          "730700419": {
            "id": "730700419",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "#Thank you, Nara {NICKNAME}! This seems to be the song left by Aramaha. If it's true, there should be a Vasara Tree nearby. We lucked out!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
