    {
      "subId": "7307006",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Arama and Arasudraka",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730700601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730700601": {
            "id": "730700601",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arasudraka",
            "text": "\"Come, come, dreams of the sprouts, memories of the leaves...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730700602"
            ]
          },
          "730700602": {
            "id": "730700602",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "\"Look, shining pomegranates, glowing Sunsettias...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730700603"
            ]
          },
          "730700603": {
            "id": "730700603",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "I see. Aranaga's song and Aramaha's song have the same source...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730700604"
            ]
          },
          "730700604": {
            "id": "730700604",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What do you mean, the same source...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730700605"
            ]
          },
          "730700605": {
            "id": "730700605",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arasudraka",
            "text": "Songs are like rivers. They derive from the same origin, the \"Sourcesong.\" She is the home to all songs and the source of all great rivers.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730700606"
            ]
          },
          "730700606": {
            "id": "730700606",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arasudraka",
            "text": "Then, it changes when it is sung for different memories and different stories, just like how a great river diverges into creeks.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730700607"
            ]
          },
          "730700607": {
            "id": "730700607",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arasudraka",
            "text": "Just like all the creeks eventually flow into the sea, all the songs eventually converge into one, into the Sourcesong.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730700608"
            ]
          },
          "730700608": {
            "id": "730700608",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arasudraka",
            "text": "#So Aranara song gatherers have to find all the songs. That way, we can find the Sourcesong. Thank you, Nara {NICKNAME} and Paimon, for finding Aramaha's song.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730700610"
            ]
          },
          "730700610": {
            "id": "730700610",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arasudraka",
            "text": "#Thank you, Nara {NICKNAME}!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730700611"
            ]
          },
          "730700611": {
            "id": "730700611",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmm... Songs will keep growing in numbers and changing along the way, so how can all the songs be found?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730700613"
            ]
          },
          "730700613": {
            "id": "730700613",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arasudraka",
            "text": "And so will Aranara. So, if we keep doing our best, there will be no problem!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730700614"
            ]
          },
          "730700614": {
            "id": "730700614",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "Aramaha's song can attract Healthy Dendrograna. His Ashvattha's Concourse should be sealed in the same way.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730700615"
            ]
          },
          "730700615": {
            "id": "730700615",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "#Nara {NICKNAME} found his song, which means we can get to Ashvattha's Concourse right away!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730700616"
            ]
          },
          "730700616": {
            "id": "730700616",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arasudraka",
            "text": "#Yes! Good luck, Nara {NICKNAME}, Paimon, and Arama! I'm going to get ready for Festival Utsava!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730700617"
            ]
          },
          "730700617": {
            "id": "730700617",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Leave it to us! See you at Festival Utsava, Arasudraka!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730700618"
            ]
          },
          "730700618": {
            "id": "730700618",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Arasudraka",
            "text": "Bye!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
