    {
      "subId": "7307013",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Arama",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730701301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730701301": {
            "id": "730701301",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Is this... the Vasara Tree? Doesn't seem as lively as Paimon imagined...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730701302"
            ]
          },
          "730701302": {
            "id": "730701302",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "Yes, Aramaha resisted very hard, and kept Marana under control to the side. If not, the nearby forest would have become even more terrible.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730701303"
            ]
          },
          "730701303": {
            "id": "730701303",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "All the leaves would fall and rot on the ground. The mushrooms would all become angry Fungi, and the birds and beasts would also lie down and return to the ground, leaving only hard white things behind.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730701304"
            ]
          },
          "730701304": {
            "id": "730701304",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Sounds really scary...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730701305"
            ]
          },
          "730701305": {
            "id": "730701305",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "#Yes, but thanks to Nara {NICKNAME} and Paimon, Marana has become a lot less troubling!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730701306"
            ]
          },
          "730701306": {
            "id": "730701306",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "If it were just Arama alone, it wouldn't have worked at all. I am too young and don't have many memories, so I am not as powerful as other Aranara.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730701307"
            ]
          },
          "730701307": {
            "id": "730701307",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "#But with memories of adventuring together with Nara {NICKNAME} and Paimon, my powers will grow!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730701309"
            ]
          },
          "730701309": {
            "id": "730701309",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yeah! Friends go on adventures together! That's the spirit!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730701311"
            ]
          },
          "730701311": {
            "id": "730701311",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "First, we must enter his dream to destroy Marana's lingering influence.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730701312"
            ]
          },
          "730701312": {
            "id": "730701312",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wait a second... When you say \"his dream,\" you mean that of the Vasara Tree?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730701313"
            ]
          },
          "730701313": {
            "id": "730701313",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "That's right. If you are ready, reach out your hand and enter his dream..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7307017",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Arama and enter the Vasara Tree's dream",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730701701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730701701": {
            "id": "730701701",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "(Reach your hand out to the Vasara Tree...)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7307019",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Arama and enter the Vasara Tree's dream",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730701901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730701901": {
            "id": "730701901",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So this is...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730701902"
            ]
          },
          "730701902": {
            "id": "730701902",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "Yes. This is a Vasoma Fruit.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730701903"
            ]
          },
          "730701903": {
            "id": "730701903",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "It is the accumulation of the dreams and memories gathered by the Vasara Tree. It's a precious fruit that can help us restore our strength.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730701904"
            ]
          },
          "730701904": {
            "id": "730701904",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "A large amount of energy must be consumed for the Ashvattha Tree to produce a Bija. That is why we must offer Vasoma Fruits.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730701905"
            ]
          },
          "730701905": {
            "id": "730701905",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "#Keep the Vasoma Fruit safe, Nara {NICKNAME}!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730701906"
            ]
          },
          "730701906": {
            "id": "730701906",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmm. You know what? Let's teach Arama the meaning of \"treasure\"!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730701907"
            ]
          },
          "730701907": {
            "id": "730701907",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Now then! \"Treasure\" refers to something very precious. This Vasoma Fruit contains lots of dreams and memories, and it can restore an Aranara's power. That makes it pretty rare and amazing, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730701908"
            ]
          },
          "730701908": {
            "id": "730701908",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "For things like Vasoma Fruits that are rare and precious, we call them \"treasure\"!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730701909"
            ]
          },
          "730701909": {
            "id": "730701909",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "Ah, so this is what treasure means... I got it! Thank you, Paimon!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730701911",
              "730701913"
            ]
          },
          "730701911": {
            "id": "730701911",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmm... Araja said that we'll need more than one Vasoma Fruit. That means we need to find other Ashvattha's Concourses, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730701914"
            ]
          },
          "730701914": {
            "id": "730701914",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Arama",
            "text": "#That's right. I'll do my best to find them! So long, Nara {NICKNAME} and Paimon!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730701915"
            ]
          },
          "730701915": {
            "id": "730701915",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "See you later, Arama!"
          },
          "730701913": {
            "id": "730701913",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What are you thanking Paimon for...? Anyway, Araja said that we'll need more than one Vasoma Fruit. That means we need to find other Ashvattha's Concourses, right?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
